      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define yearly contributions and limits\n    contributions = [6000, 7500, 6000]\n    annual_limit = 5500\n    monthly_penalty_rate = 0.01\n    penalty_months = 12\n\n    # Calculate the total penalty on annual over-contributions\n    total_over_contribution = sum(\n        max(0, contribution - annual_limit)\n        for contribution in contributions\n    )\n    total_penalty = total_over_contribution * monthly_penalty_rate * penalty_months\n\n    # Return the answer rounded to two decimal places\n    return round(total_penalty, 2)\n```",
